	(property "Description" "Sunlord MWSA0402S-1R0MT / C408332, intentional prototype selection. 1uH +/-20%, DCR27mOhm max, Isat table Max/Typ5.6/7A and Irms Max/Typ5.4/6A; table headings preserved, no guaranteed minimum inferred. Same primary lands/body as B01. Normal5V-only sink5.5V/Lmin0.8uH/f1.38MHz scenario at3A gives3.623A peak,3.022A RMS; historical13.5V screening gives4.529A peak and5.435A with20% margin. Reverse boost must remain disabled in prototype bring-up; firmware enforcement is not yet implemented. OCP/hot saturation/thermal qualification remains NOT_RUN."
